#: badend5:badend5_5D7A5D26_0D02_4F27_98DD_7C5277A389E1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e355ed0df7dcac8400fe4317d4ed059140f52be86fc6f5eb3c32a07ac11a119e
