#: badend5:badend5_F770B190_B8F6_499E_8CEC_B78F26A93231
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 306f3cda8ff31b8b24e048b7cffb2e6e303877ac8b6e9ebebdfc26121903f094
